From 18f64c7daf1a1383cb495ee1a43cbf30906051df Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nicky Pochinkov <work@nicky.pro>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 12:39:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(server): offer a TLS client certificate on outbound
 fetch

Machines behind a client-certificate gate (self-hosted T3 Connect via
t3gate) refuse peer links from servers that can't present one, so the
desktop's built-in server couldn't link to them. If
<T3 home>/client-cert/client.{crt,key} (or T3CODE_TLS_CLIENT_CERT/KEY)
exist, install an HTTP/1.1 undici Agent that offers it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 apps/server/src/binCli.ts            |  7 ++-
 apps/server/src/outboundHttp.test.ts | 68 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 apps/server/src/outboundHttp.ts      | 47 +++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 121 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

